08:33.000 --> 08:36.320
the real answer. That's what I'm looking for, so that it's that plan, that's fine.

08:36.820 --> 08:39.380
So then that satisfies that if we just keep the landline?

08:39.760 --> 08:43.140
Yeah. Okay. So my question is, how recently have

08:43.640 --> 08:47.040
